<title>BELGIUM: EU cuts export refunds.</title>
<headline>EU cuts export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cut export  refunds for all farm products by 5 percent, reflecting the strong  dollar, a spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>He said the cut had been effective from 2200 GMT Thurday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Last night, because of an increase in the dollar, we cut refunds  for all products across the board by five percent applicable from  midnight (2200 GMT),&quot; the spokesman, Gerard Kiely, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
